vulnerabilities.suggested_fix:
Add explicit target validation in createProposal() before pushing actions. For example:
```solidity
error InvalidTarget();
...
for (uint256 i; i < _actions.length; ) {
    address to = _actions[i].to;
    if (to == address(this) || to == address(lockManager)) revert InvalidTarget();
    proposal_.actions.push(_actions[i]);
    unchecked { ++i; }
}
```
Additionally, consider forbidding DelegateCall execution mode entirely for this plugin (or enforce an allowlist of safe targets) to prevent any delegatecall-based execution hazards.
